---
// The affiliate disclosure, as a component instead of a pasted {% include %}.
//
// Under MkDocs this partial was included by hand on 29 pages, which means it
// could be forgotten, reordered, or moved above the content it is disclosing.
// As a component it renders identically everywhere, and once it moves into the
// page layout it cannot be omitted at all.
---

<details class="affiliate-disclosure">
  <summary><strong>Affiliate Disclosure</strong></summary>
  <p>
    This page contains affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, we may
    earn a small commission — <strong>at no extra cost to you</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    These commissions pay for hosting and let us keep the wiki running. They never
    influence what we recommend: see our
    <a href="/policies/">editorial policy</a> for how we choose what to cover.
  </p>
</details>

<style>
  .affiliate-disclosure {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7, var(--sl-color-gray-6));
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
  }
  .affiliate-disclosure summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .affiliate-disclosure p {
    margin-block: 0.6rem 0;
  }
</style>
